{"pageid": 1345, "title": "Dolly", "revid": 2788, "categories": ["Characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)", "Deceased", "House of Cutter", "Monsters", "Phantasmatypes", "Totems"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Dolly</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/54/Dolly.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250226163838\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Dolly\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/54/Dolly.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250226163838\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/54/Dolly.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250226163838 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/54/Dolly.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250226163838 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Dolly\" width=\"270\" height=\"300\" data-image-key=\"Dolly.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Dolly.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phantasmatype\" title=\"Phantasmatype\">Phantasmatype</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown, likely Deceased<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC35&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC35-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">Totem</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #22</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #35</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">My <i>mistress</i> doesn't like when people take her things. She might have let you live, but not she'll hunt you down and rip each of you apart.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Dolly to <a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi Lopez</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_30\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 30\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #30</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Dolly</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasmatypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Phantasmatypes\">Phantasmatype</a> monster bound to <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ3V0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Cutter</span>. She served as a <a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">Totem</a> for her master and was very beloved by her, being highly protected and defended against anyone who so much as slighted her. After the death of Charlotte Cutter, it is unknown what happened to Dolly, but she was most likely destroyed as is tradition.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22\">Issue #22</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23\">Issue #23</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_24\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 24\">Issue #24</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_25\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 25\">Issue #25</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_26\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 26\">Issue #26</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_27\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 27\">Issue #27</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_28\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 28\">Issue #28</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 29\">Issue #29</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_24\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 24\">Issue #30</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_31\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 31\">Issue #31</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_32\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 32\">Issue #32</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_33\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 33\">Issue #33</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_34\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 34\">Issue #34</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\">Issue #35</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books_of_Slaughter\"><i>Books of Slaughter</i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Boo